Uh and that's where a lot of the early pioneering work was done by people like Nick Phillips uh at the Loughborough University.

32
00:01:40,400 --> 00:01:47,120
Uh and I'm sure I would have been a case of uh seeing some uh exhibits, probably aged about ten, so in the the mid seventies.

33
00:01:47,120 --> 00:01:48,880
Uh you you can do the math.

34
00:01:49,120 --> 00:01:49,360
Okay.

35
00:01:50,960 --> 00:02:17,000
Um and just uh being really wowed by uh this ability to um you know view a three dimensional image held within a two dimensional plane um and something that for me felt always lacking in conventional art um was that you know we we live and inhabit a three dimensional world so you know why does art have to be uh constrained to two dimensions uh and so I guess that that really kind of made an impact on on me at an early age.

36
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:22,760
