Yeah.

39
00:02:24,680 --> 00:02:28,760
I mean most kids that are ten years old will see a hologram and go, Oh that's cool, that's cool.

40
00:02:28,760 --> 00:02:32,200
But you actually had something be some thought behind it.

41
00:02:32,200 --> 00:02:36,600
Uh I guess uh yeah all the way through school I'd had a bit of an artistic inclination.

42
00:02:36,600 --> 00:02:48,520
