I mean uh I I think as well is as much to do with um kind of the the sort of true vein of fine art actually it being a a self exploratory process.

105
00:07:54,160 --> 00:08:06,480
Um you know I was trying to depict something of who I was, where I'm coming from, where I was going to um I mean there's a there's a piece um called Icarus which uh draws on on that ancient story.

106
00:08:06,480 --> 00:08:07,600
Yeah it's gorgeous.

