00:08:08,800 --> 00:08:09,920
It's gorgeous.

109
00:08:10,080 --> 00:08:10,640
Thank you.

110
00:08:10,960 --> 00:08:20,720
Uh that was kind of the idea of of trying to get a sense of of feathers, you know so to follow on the story of of Icarus who didn't listen to his father and tried to float too close to the the sun.

111
00:08:20,720 --> 00:08:29,440
