He's approaching um uh mainstream museums and asking them uh you know how and where could they use holography uh or would they feel it applicable to use and I guess he invited me because I've got um some interest and some experience in in both spheres and I'd been an art holographone I would also actually after leaving laser holograms where I worked for many years I uh I've done six years at the British Museum uh so product development manager.

167
00:12:41,720 --> 00:12:43,960
Oh okay yeah I remember reading about that story.

